  "title": "Nourishing Chinese Corned Beef Skewers",
  "description": "Buttery and shattering post-workout Chinese dish featuring sashimi-cut corned beef, grilled to perfection on a binchotan grill, this recipe is a raw-friendly and healthy option for those looking for a nourishing meal.",
