  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the binchotan grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together sesame oil, butter, ginger, garlic, soy sauce, and honey.",
    "Add the corned beef strips to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the marinated corned beef strips onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Season the skewers with salt and black pepper.",
    "Grill the skewers for 3-4 minutes per side, or until the corned beef is cooked through and slightly charred.",
    "Garnish with chopped green onions and sesame seeds.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
